# 025 · RunPod tests and how-to

**Status:** `READY` · **Version:** [v0.1.0](../roadmap.md#v010) · **Part:** Rigs on RunPod · **Depends on:** [022](022-runpod-launch.goal), [023](023-runpod-lifecycle.goal), [024](024-runpod-models-and-results.goal)

## What

A fake RunPod API for CI, one paid acceptance run by hand, and a how-to: "Run a rig on RunPod".

## Why

The RunPod path must be tested without paid GPU time on every change.

## Done when

- [ ] CI covers launch, enrollment, stop, start and terminate against the fake API.
- [ ] The paid run is recorded in Progress.
- [ ] The how-to is in the docs index.

## Decisions

None yet.

## Open questions

None.

## Progress

